msgstr "Ergebnisse archivieren"

#: evap/staff/templates/staff_semester_view.html:205
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Do you really want to archive the results in the semester "
"<strong>%(semester_name)s</strong>? This will make the results of all "
"evaluations inaccessible for all users except their contributors and "
"managers. You can't undo this action."
